  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2018-10-12T02:04:01.424Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "So a few people and I where world hoping lately and we saw that a popular large sized world been updated.\n\nWe went in thinking there was new stuff to look at and it was the same as before.\n\nAfter going to that worlds discord I found out that it was just a glitch fix due to a recent vrchat update.\n\nThat got myself thinking.  We only have a name and a picture to provide information to people about what a world is and what updates have been done.\n\nSo I thought why not add an info button when you select the world that brings up a panel that shows world information wrote by the world maker.  This is where you can put a description, Credits, Tags and updates what ever the world maker wants to provide to the public.",
